The problem asks us to calculate the sum of $f(P)$ over all permutations $P$ of $(1, 2, \ldots, N)$, modulo 998244353.
Here, $f(P)$ is formed by concatenating the decimal representations of the numbers in the permutation.
Let $A = (A_1, A_2, \ldots, A_N)$ be a permutation of $(1, 2, \ldots, N)$.
